# Benkei Gaiden: Suna no Shou (SNES) — Credits / Chapter Card Overlay Table
# Used when $00:F552 overlays compressed entry 97 onto $7E:4000..$533F ($F100..$F199).
# Note: 20 $F0xx codes in base ben_092 that collide with glyphs also in ben_097 are
# tagged as {sF0xx} so decode <-> encode roundtrip remains 100% unique and lossless.

FD={nl}
FE={page}
FF={end}
10=\s

# Non-colliding base-font kanji used in $1D:F59F..$F7F7
F0A3=下
F24D=進
F3DD=友

